    {
      "id": "148:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:35330:35332"
    },
    {
      "id": "148:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你猛地转身以最快的速度冲回小屋。你急促地吸着空气，肺像是烧着了。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:35332:35366"
    },
    {
      "id": "148:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "血管搏动的砰砰声充满了你的耳朵，几乎听不到身后陌生人沉重的脚步声。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:35366:35401"
    },
    {
      "id": "148:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你跑到小屋所在的空地边缘，壮着胆子回头看了一眼。你什么也没看到。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:35401:35435"
    },
    {
      "id": "148:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "他不见了。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:35435:35442"
    },
    {
      "id": "148:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "转到 170。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:35442:35451"
    }
  ]
}
